Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.50,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an8}NIGHT CITY — 2:14 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.20,Default,Idris,0,0,0,,Mara, are you still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:10.40,Default,Mara,0,0,0,,I can't sleep.\NThe city is too loud tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.30,Default,Idris,0,0,0,,Then let's go up to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.20,Default,Mara,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it safe?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.40,Default,Idris,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.80,Default,Idris,0,0,0,,Look — every light down there\Nis someone's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:28.00,Default,Mara,0,0,0,,You sound like your father, Idris.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.60,Default,Idris,0,0,0,,He taught me to watch the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:37.00,Default,Idris,0,0,0,,Then let's watch it together, Mara.
